# Subagents

Parent writes the answer. A subagent gets a short brief and the paths it needs, then returns a compact summary. Do not paste a raw path dump into the chat.

| When | Who | Model |
|---|---|---|
| Wide locate, 3+ files, 15+ hits | caveman-explore | composer-2.5-fast |
| Diff or multi-file review | caveman-review | composer-2.5-fast |
| Tests, lint, a live pull | highspeed | composer-2.5-fast |
| Docs a person will read | md-plain-language | composer-2.5-fast |
| Claimed done, before push | adversarial-verifier | inherit |
| One file, one fact | stay in the parent | — |

Under about 40% of the context window, the parent edits. Past that, pass a brief and paths, not a transcript. Past about 75%, write a handoff (goal, paths, decisions, the verify command) and start a new chat.

Skip a spawn for a one-line fix. Do not copy another repo's domain rules into this one.
